  "comparison": {
    "quantity": "The exit rate of the low-FRET and of the high-FRET class, 1 / mean residence time (s^-1). For a 2-state model it is k12 and k21; for a model with hidden states it is the rate of the aggregated class (stationary entry flux), comparable to the pooled dwell-time MLE 1/<tau> of Tether's Viterbi paths.",
